":"Cảm ơn ngài đã chỉ dẫn!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":65,"uid":"zhcn:9f2bdc2a93fdcafad6e354f4","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"少し気合いを入れます。\r\n…やってやるぜぇぇぇ！\r\nうん。いい感じです。","source_fingerprint":"22b08c5f538325e35fd18d6fc03671ed1e534b0987a69a8276411743316988bf","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","2033"],"target_text":"Tôi sẽ lên tinh thần một chút.\r\n...Làm tới luôn nààào!\r\nỪm. Cảm giác ổn đấy.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":66,"uid":"zhcn:a0d076bc1696c80738c9d463","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"いくら眩しくても目は閉じないで\r\nください。今日お見せするのが\r\n光速を超えた、私の最高速です！","source_fingerprint":"4d57990bc9eb7a96973cd4c618293c550518d4ede6ea6c968a3f44c9fea3230e","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","2034"],"target_text":"Dù có chói đến đâu cũng đừng nhắm mắt.\r\nTốc độ tôi cho ngài thấy hôm nay là\r\ntốc độ tối đa vượt cả ánh sáng!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":67,"uid":"zhcn:f300bf26e73d3c2231bce7ae","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"ご指導ありがとうございました！","source_fingerprint":"fce8804b80bc4bca14c035bc8af214a3c6ee66d8fe782a65cc55a5925d0f5389","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","2035"],"target_text":"Cảm ơn ngài đã chỉ dẫn!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":68,"uid":"zhcn:6ef67406c388f39dd1782e88","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"いくぞ！","source_fingerprint":"cba7776c7f432b141e5a619b9f8e42077ad110b65fd916413b0b5d7b49ddc152","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","23015"],"target_text":"Đi nào!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":69,"uid":"zhcn:21d062cb2a2765e17e7dd1dd","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"いける…次こそ、光の先へ！","source_fingerprint":"edb3d75ce480aa06c7d1368f583b29e2078fe84f0a43302660e700c1f6dca36e","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","30000"],"target_text":"Được... Lần tới nhất định, vượt qua cả ánh sáng!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":70,"uid":"zhcn:e93981ec293f36f371ad8100","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"光は、見えた…！","source_fingerprint":"e26fa96cdc78580edf5b60625830df80537845447d1778221fb2618a4c6fecc3","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","30001"],"target_text":"Tôi thấy ánh sáng rồi...!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":71,"uid":"zhcn:5ab5d17526aa6e2075441b5d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"最高速には至らず、か…！","source_fingerprint":"028bbbb62559c59b214ce3b31759aba27a1e683fe13c840ea86f485da32bf866","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","30002"],"target_text":"Vẫn chưa đạt tới tốc độ tối đa sao...!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":72,"uid":"zhcn:549d00a33d5df81fe2dbe5df","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"く…これではインパラにも笑われる…！","source_fingerprint":"01080e97ab372d07d706a8839aac278e08260d03fc09b9a9847388fbe5a0bf7e","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","30003"],"target_text":"Khụ... thế này thì đến impala cũng cười tôi mất...!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":73,"uid":"zhcn:1891a20ff64672bb11f1d3c4","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"見えた。光を超えた世界…！","source_fingerprint":"05c5630a1ef9e942000d76a129b988b98f3efe46f7d659ddfaf99043b8fc6b14","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","30004"],"target_text":"Tôi thấy rồi. Thế giới vượt qua ánh sáng...!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":74,"uid":"zhcn:b6d2d3bcb5f81a53aea591f1","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"フッ、捉えられたかな。これが光の速さ！","source_fingerprint":"aa285f8548615a98f4dc4949664fd22fb39b68676772bfa2d2d7de4867a99e20","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1120","30005"],"target_text":"Hừm, theo kịp chứ? Đây chính là tốc độ ánh sáng!","reviewed":true}]}